              "content": "Single HTTP endpoint for the Flipside Data API. The JSON-RPC `method` field selects the operation (createQuery, getQueryRun, getQueryRunResults, cancelQueryRun) and `params` carries an array with a single parameters object. All calls require the x-api-key header.",
